                                  "pad_left": 10
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "group": "",
                          "groupIndex": 0,
                          "text": "Supports the following specifications:\\n1.  USB 2.0 and USB 3.2 data loopback \n    testing.\\n2. Up to 240W of power loading and \n    sourcing.\\n3. Up to 7.5W per port for VCONN power \\n    loading and sourcing.\\n4. IR drop compensation through VBUS             voltage sense line.",
                          "textType": "literal",
                          "longMode": "WRAP",
                          "recolor": false
                        },
